flowchart LR
    accTitle: How the food tracking MCP fits together
    accDescr: You talk to Claude or another LLM client, which calls the MCP server running as a Cloudflare Worker in your own account, after signing in with GitHub. The Worker stores your logs in D1, keeps sign-in grants in KV, and looks up foods from USDA and Open Food Facts. GitHub Actions deploys the Worker but never serves requests.
    C["AI Agent<br />ex. Claude"]
    C -->|"log foods + get progress"| W["Worker<br />mcp"]
    W --> D[("food data + <br />login grants")]
    W -->|"find food"| F["USDA +<br/>Open Food Facts"]
    C -.->|"add connector"| G["GitHub<br/>Auth"]

    G -.-> W
    A["GitHub Actions"] -->|"deploy"| W

    classDef you fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1e3a8a
    classDef code fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#14532d
    classDef data fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#78350f
    classDef outside fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#4c1d95
    classDef auto fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#64748b,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#0f172a
    class C you
    class W code
    class D,K data
    class F,G outside
    class A auto
